        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F7F9FA] p-6 border border-slate-200">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1F2A30]">Signs You Need Gum Treatment</h2>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Red, puffy, or tender gums that bleed while brushing or spitting.</li>
            <li>Bad breath or an unpleasant taste that returns quickly after rinsing.</li>
            <li>Pus or fluid oozing when pressing gently on the gums.</li>
            <li>Gums pulling back, making teeth appear longer than before.</li>
            <li>Teeth feeling slightly loose or shifting gaps between front teeth.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
