              <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold text-[#1F2A30]">Gentle Sub-Gum Tartar Removal</h3>
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-600">Using topical numbing gel and fine ultrasonic tips, hidden tartar under the gumline is flushed cleanly so swollen gums can heal naturally.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ol class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-base text-slate-700 list-decimal pl-5">
            <li><strong>Gum &amp; X-Ray Check:</strong> Dr. Shubham Gupta measures gum pocket depth and uses a digital X-ray if needed to check bone support.</li>
            <li><strong>Deep Scaling &amp; Root Cleaning:</strong> Hardened tartar above and gently beneath the gumline is cleared using ultrasonic tips and fine hand instruments under numbing gel or local anaesthesia.</li>
            <li><strong>Antibacterial Rinse &amp; Medication:</strong> Pockets are flushed clean, and medicated mouthwash or short medication is advised where infection is active.</li>
            <li><strong>Follow-Up Review:</strong> A re-check ensures gums are tightening comfortably back around the teeth.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
